Meghanada rallies fleeing host and routs gods --- Indra rallies gods and sends Jayanta forth --- Meghanada batters Jayanta and darkens worlds --- Puloma bears grandson Jayanta to ocean --- Indra mounts roaring chariot amid omens --- Ravana mounts serpent chariot and meets Indra --- Kumbhakarna rages indiscriminately and suffers wounds --- Gods rout rakshasa ranks into bloody river --- Ravana charges Indra and duels in darkness
